// ============================================================
// Purchasing: the personas canvas - the thinking around the personas who work here.
//
// Goals live on the personas themselves (Shared/access.play); what sits around them is on sticky notes: the context they work in,
// what gets in their way, what success looks like and what is still open. Authoring metadata only: it never reaches the running application.
// The personas are laid out by the canvas in a grid, so the notes sit below them: blue for context, pink for pain, green for success, yellow for questions.
// ============================================================

sticky note on personas
  description "Context: plans replenishment once a week and orders from a short list of trusted suppliers."
  colour blue
  position 110 650
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Pain point: low-stock signals arrive as emails. Wants them as a worklist."
  colour pink
  position 380 650
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Success: a purchase order goes out the same day stock falls below its reorder point."
  colour green
  position 650 650
  size 250 150

sticky note on personas
  description "Question: do suppliers confirm a purchase order, or do we assume they received it?"
  position 920 650
  size 250 150
